OL,3,GNEWSARail replacement plans for
OL,4,ANewcastle to Edinburgh
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrain passengers are being warned of
OL,7,Freplacement bus services and diversions
OL,8,Fbetween Newcastle and Edinburgh for
OL,9,Fupgrade works.
OL,11,FServices will be disrupted on the
OL,12,Fweekends of 19 and 20 September, 26 and
OL,13,F27 September and 3 and 4 October.
OL,15,FNetwork Rail said a #7.1m investment
OL,16,Fwould include track renewal, upgrades
OL,17,Fto switches and crossings, improved
OL,18,Fdrainage systems and renewed overhead
OL,19,Fline equipment.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,446,440,260,160,0,100
